Useless nonterminals

   type_name_list
   copy_generic_opt_arg_list
   copy_generic_opt_arg_list_item
   columnrefList
   extended_indirection
   ident_name
   ident_list


Terminals which are not used

   DOT_DOT


Useless rules

  2540 type_name_list: Typename
  2541               | type_name_list ',' Typename

  2542 copy_generic_opt_arg_list: copy_generic_opt_arg_list_item
  2543                          | copy_generic_opt_arg_list ',' copy_generic_opt_arg_list_item

  2544 copy_generic_opt_arg_list_item: opt_boolean_or_string

  2545 columnrefList: columnref
  2546              | columnrefList ',' columnref

  2547 extended_indirection: extended_indirection_el
  2548                     | extended_indirection extended_indirection_el

  2549 ident_name: IDENT

  2550 ident_list: ident_name
  2551           | ident_list ',' ident_name


Grammar

    0 $accept: stmtblock $end

    1 stmtblock: stmtmulti

    2 stmtmulti: stmtmulti ';' stmt
    3          | stmt

    4 stmt: AlterDatabaseStmt
    5     | AlterObjectSchemaStmt
    6     | AlterSeqStmt
    7     | AlterTableStmt
    8     | AnalyzeStmt
